# Real client data - uploads, generated dubs, the SQLite db itself. This
# is a VOLUME at runtime (see Dockerfile), never image content - without
# this line, `COPY webapp/ webapp/` would bake ~1.9GB of real order data
# straight into the image (and, worse, into any registry it gets pushed
# to).
webapp/data/

.git/
.gitignore
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.example
data/voices/
data/audio/
*.wav
*.mp3
!webapp/static/*.wav
.DS_Store
tests/
